# ============================================================
# White-list Git policy
# 默认忽略 RA-ILD 项目中的全部内容
# 只允许指定脚本目录和少量仓库说明文件进入 Git
# ============================================================

# 默认忽略所有文件和目录
*

# ---------- 仓库根目录允许的文件 ----------
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md

# ---------- TRB ----------
!TRB/
TRB/*

!TRB/scripts/
!TRB/scripts/**

!TRB/set/
TRB/set/*

!TRB/set/scripts/
!TRB/set/scripts/**

# ---------- IGH ----------
!IGH/
IGH/*

!IGH/set/
IGH/set/*

!IGH/set/scripts/
!IGH/set/scripts/**

# ---------- TRB + IGH ----------
!TRB_IGH/
TRB_IGH/*

!TRB_IGH/set/
TRB_IGH/set/*

!TRB_IGH/set/scripts/
!TRB_IGH/set/scripts/**

# ---------- 即使位于脚本目录中，也不要上传 ----------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/*.tmp

# 脚本备份文件
**/*.bak
**/*.bak.*